            "level": {
              "value": 1
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You quickly assess your prey and apply what you know. As part of the action used to Hunt your Prey, you can attempt a check to Recall Knowledge about your prey. When you critically succeed at identifying your hunted prey with Recall Knowledge, you note a weakness in the creature's defenses in addition to any other benefits. You and allies you tell gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your next attack roll against that prey.\n\nYou can give bonuses from Monster Hunter only once per day against a particular creature."
            }
          }
        }
